    "sender-name": "Dr. Patrick Nkhoma",
    "sender-designation": "Managing Director",
    "currentTemplate": "executive",
    "includeSignature": true,
    "letter-body": "<p>Greetings from DALP Consultancy Services.</p>\n<p>DALP Consultancy Services has proudly served students, professionals, and institutions for more than two decades by providing comprehensive international education and immigration support. Our services include university placement, application processing, visa guidance, career counselling, IELTS registration, accommodation arrangements, and pre-departure orientation. We have established partnerships with leading universities across Australia, Canada, the United Kingdom, New Zealand, Europe, the United States, and other international destinations.</p>\n<p>The mining industry is rapidly evolving through technological innovation, sustainability initiatives, and environmental responsibility. These changes require professionals with internationally recognized knowledge and practical expertise.</p>\n<p>We believe there is significant value in collaborating with ZCCM Investments Holdings by creating pathways for employees, graduates, and young professionals to pursue specialized international education in mining engineering, geology, metallurgy, environmental management, occupational health and safety, business leadership, and emerging technologies.</p>\n<p>Beyond student recruitment, DALP seeks to become a long-term strategic partner that connects Zambian talent with world-class academic institutions capable of developing future industry leaders.</p>\n<p>We would appreciate an opportunity to present our services and discuss how we may support your organization's capacity-building objectives through customized educational partnerships.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your consideration. We look forward to hearing from you.</p>",
